+# Performance history
+
+## UserPromptSubmit read path
+
+On the adversarial synthetic corpus with a 30-word vocabulary, the measured
+full-recall `UserPromptSubmit` p95 was **10.27 ms** before the term-selection
+fix.
+
+The fix made term selection discard terms whose document frequency is greater
+than one third of the corpus (`df > n/3`), preventing ubiquitous terms from
+creating very large posting-list scans. The synthetic benchmark vocabulary was
+also changed to a Zipf-shaped distribution: 30 frequent domain words plus
+2,000 rare identifiers.
+
+After that change, the measured full-recall `UserPromptSubmit` p95 was
+**1.82 ms**.
